    "commit": "766da7c5a",
    "summary": "Post-build review found three P2s against t4's RECEIPTS machinery when exercised through a real RoundWriter/LifecycleService rather than the raw writer: no codec registered for RECEIPTS (UnknownArtifactKindError), persistVerificationReceipt collapsing an unreadable prior record into absent (destructive replacement), and RECEIPTS missing from STORY_RECORD_KINDS (never frozen on Story completion). Registered the codec, added a receiptRecordState-based refusal (ReceiptRecordUnreadableError) instead of the collapse, and added RECEIPTS to the completion/reopen membership list, with tests for all three through a real createRepoLifecycle-backed LifecycleService."
  },
